graph LR
    subgraph Client[终端]
        Browser[Web 浏览器]
        Mobile[移动端 H5]
    end

    Browser & Mobile --> CDN[CDN/静态资源分发]
    CDN --> WAF[WAF 安全防护]
    WAF --> Ingress[Ingress Controller]

    subgraph Platform[平台层]
        Ingress --> Gateway[API 网关]
        Gateway --> AuthSvc[认证服务]
        Gateway --> CourseSvc[课程服务]
        Gateway --> AssignmentSvc[作业服务]
        Gateway --> ResourceSvc[资源服务]
        Gateway --> AnalyticsSvc[分析服务]
        Gateway --> NotificationSvc[通知服务]
        Gateway --> OpsSvc[运维监控服务]
    end

    subgraph Infra[基础设施]
        Postgres[(PostgreSQL 集群)]
        Redis[(Redis 集群)]
        MQ[(RabbitMQ 队列)]
        ObjStore[(对象存储 MinIO)]
        ES[(Elasticsearch 审计库)]
        DW[(数据仓库/统计视图)]
        Config[(配置中心 Config Server)]
    end

    AuthSvc --> Redis
    AuthSvc --> SSO[学校统一身份认证]
    SSO --> AuthSvc
    CourseSvc --> Postgres
    AssignmentSvc --> Postgres
    ResourceSvc --> ObjStore
    ResourceSvc --> Postgres
    ResourceSvc --> MQ
    NotificationSvc --> MQ
    MQ --> NotificationWorker[通知 Worker]
    NotificationWorker --> Mail[邮件服务]
    NotificationWorker --> WeCom[企业微信]
    NotificationWorker --> Inbox[站内信]

    AssignmentSvc --> ES
    OpsSvc --> ES
    AnalyticsSvc --> DW
    DW --> AnalyticsSvc

    Config --> AuthSvc & CourseSvc & AssignmentSvc & ResourceSvc & NotificationSvc & AnalyticsSvc & OpsSvc

    subgraph Observability[可观测性]
        Prometheus[(Prometheus)]
        Loki[(日志收集 Loki)]
        Grafana[(Grafana)]
    end

    Prometheus -->|采集| Gateway
    Prometheus -->|采集| CourseSvc
    Prometheus -->|采集| AssignmentSvc
    Prometheus -->|采集| NotificationSvc
    Loki --> ES
    OpsSvc --> Prometheus
    OpsSvc --> Loki
    Grafana --> Prometheus
    Grafana --> Loki
